  ],
  "rules": [
    "Initial entities carry clock '' (older than any op).",
    "A put or patch sets each field whose clock is older than the op's hlc; a patch to an entity never seen is ignored.",
    "A delete records a tombstone (newest one wins). An entity is visible iff it has no tombstone or its newest field clock is newer than the tombstone; a deleted entity's data is kept hidden so later ops still update it.",
    "Ops with an id already applied are skipped.",
    "command and commandResult ops do not change entity state.",
    "Results must not depend on arrival order, given that a patch never arrives before the put that created its entity."
  ]
}
